## Pre-release v0.2.3 | 2026-08-13
- [PERMISSION] Added automatic group-based title system using LuckPerms
  - Default (毛玉)
  - VIP (妖精)
  - SVIP (天狗)
  - XVIP (贤者)
  - Admin (神明)
- [FUNCTION] Integrated LuckPerms prefixes with TAB
- [FUNCTION] Added automatic title display to the TAB scoreboard
- [ECONOMY] Added in-game currency display to the TAB scoreboard
- [ECONOMY] Added 茂祢币 (PlayerPoints) display to the TAB scoreboard
- [ECONOMY] Added EssentialsX Economy balance display via Vault
- [INTEGRATION] Improved PlaceholderAPI integration with LuckPerms, Vault, and PlayerPoints
- [FIX] Replaced raw permission group names with formatted titles in the TAB scoreboard
- [CONFIG] Updated TAB configuration for automatic title and economy display

