## Release v1.2.1 | 2026-08-26
- [PERMISSION] Updated LuckPerms group system

  * Default → 小猫
  * Intermediate → 中猫
  * High → 大猫
  * VIP → 灵猫
  * SVIP → 玄猫
  * XVIP → 天猫
  * Admin → 猫神
- [PERMISSION] Separated permanent player ranks from temporary VIP memberships
- [PERMISSION] Added temporary VIP / SVIP / XVIP membership system

  * VIP: 30 days
  * SVIP: 30 days
  * XVIP: 30 days
- [ECONOMY] Added tier-based Residence limits and discounts

  * Default: 50×50, 100%
  * Intermediate: 80×80, 95%
  * High: 100×100, 90%
  * VIP: 150×150, 80%
  * SVIP: 300×300, 70%
  * XVIP: 1000×1000, 50%
- [PERMISSION] Added SVIP flight permission
- [PERMISSION] Added XVIP flight and player teleport permission
- [KIT] Added separate VIP / SVIP / XVIP daily kits
- [ECONOMY] Added tier-based VIP membership purchases

  * VIP: 200,000 dollars (游戏币) / 30 days
  * SVIP: 380 points (茂祢币) / 30 days
  * XVIP: 1,080 points (茂祢币) / 30 days

